1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,441
Chart ki har candle ek kahani

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:03,221
batati hai.

3
00:00:03,241 --> 00:00:04,601
Chalo padhna seekho,

4
00:00:04,621 --> 00:00:05,962
45 second mein.

5
00:00:05,982 --> 00:00:07,703
Ek candle mein 4 cheezein

6
00:00:07,723 --> 00:00:08,377
hoti hain:

7
00:00:08,397 --> 00:00:08,714
open,

8
00:00:08,734 --> 00:00:09,051
high,

9
00:00:09,071 --> 00:00:09,331
low,

10
00:00:09,351 --> 00:00:10,285
aur close.

11
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:11,563
Mota hissa body hai.

12
00:00:11,583 --> 00:00:13,374
Yeh open se close tak jaata

13
00:00:13,394 --> 00:00:13,920
hai.

14
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,478
Upar aur neeche ki patli

15
00:00:15,498 --> 00:00:15,789
line,

16
00:00:15,809 --> 00:00:16,360
wick hai.

17
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,917
Woh din ka high aur low

18
00:00:17,937 --> 00:00:18,924
dikhati hai.

19
00:00:18,944 --> 00:00:19,311
Close,

20
00:00:19,331 --> 00:00:20,474
open se upar hua,

21
00:00:20,494 --> 00:00:21,582
toh candle green.

22
00:00:21,602 --> 00:00:23,357
Matlab khareedaar jeete.

23
00:00:23,377 --> 00:00:23,761
Close,

24
00:00:23,781 --> 00:00:25,091
open se neeche hua,

25
00:00:25,111 --> 00:00:26,132
toh candle red.

26
00:00:26,152 --> 00:00:28,088
Matlab bechne wale jeete.

27
00:00:28,108 --> 00:00:28,794
Example:

28
00:00:28,814 --> 00:00:30,598
share ₹100 pe khula,

29
00:00:30,618 --> 00:00:31,853
₹107 tak gaya,

30
00:00:31,873 --> 00:00:33,029
₹95 tak gira,

31
00:00:33,049 --> 00:00:35,270
aur ₹105 pe band hua.

32
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,261
Toh green candle,

33
00:00:36,281 --> 00:00:37,252
upar chhoti wick,

34
00:00:37,272 --> 00:00:38,572
neeche lambi wick.

35
00:00:38,592 --> 00:00:39,947
Lambi wick bolti hai:

36
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:41,047
price wahan gaya,

37
00:00:41,067 --> 00:00:42,592
par tik nahi paaya.

38
00:00:42,612 --> 00:00:43,591
Par yaad rakho,

39
00:00:43,611 --> 00:00:45,477
ek candle future nahi batati.

40
00:00:45,497 --> 00:00:47,252
Yeh bas batati hai ki kya

41
00:00:47,272 --> 00:00:47,809
hua.

42
00:00:47,829 --> 00:00:50,696
Follow karo The 7% Club.
